    "body": "```\r\n$ echo ${__bp_imported:-}\r\ndefined\r\n```\r\n\r\nYes, `iterm2_shell_integration.bash` definitely [uses a flavor of the `bash-preexec` framework](https://github.com/gnachman/iTerm2/blob/master/Resources/shell_integration/iterm2_shell_integration.bash#L83).\r\n\r\n<img width=\"705\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1992842/205455810-25c63acd-75dd-4e03-bed5-7bd57a0fbee6.png\">\r\n",
